{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1494.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"ed727ea9319a1d46b9b4851f0bcb193f8309d3f18ec7a351fc9236aca4e4a04d","ja":"わ、私も、ついさっきスタッフさんから\n聞いたばっかりなんですけど……。","zh":"我、我也是刚才听工作人员\n说起才知道的……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1494.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"d8465da72003e63b6fee5b3f48514ad441b707a7a4e4ba405c3d1a34ad0079e2","ja":"会場視察のときに、誰もいない方から足音がしたり、\n扉が勝手に開いたり、したらしくって……。","zh":"在视察会场的时候，好像听到了没人的方向传来脚步声，\n门自己打开之类的……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1494.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"708fbbe467a349b4a1efdf46759570e002f966b1587eb4ca9565ec77a8a8ad86","ja":"き、気になって調べたら……\nネットで有名な心霊スポットだったそうなんですぅ～！","zh":"我、我因为在意去查了一下……\n据说是网上很有名的灵异地点啊～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1494.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"777ffbe98c7d60f50dfb1c95e8b96a8c44650621786f61eb91f2ddd5175e20df","ja":"な、なんと………………。\n………………………………。","zh":"怎、怎么会………………。\n………………………………。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1494.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"955470c891589f77ccd5ee7ab312da8ffbbbc998be5c2aaca103d1a325c493c4","ja":"あ、あの……四条さん？\nどうしました？","zh":"那个……四条小姐？\n怎么了吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1494.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"5401f4f0493cc12a2664300c9ba5348058f626aeb72c241294985941efd1ec36","ja":"い、いえ……。\nそれはなんとも……面妖なお話、かと……。","zh":"没、没有……。\n这还真是……有些蹊跷呢……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1494.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"a51bd3490388f309612054dc063ad9896f39fee34f2d3de4cdca85b63e5cb028","ja":"（あれ？　四条さん、なんだか震えて……）","zh":"（奇怪？四条小姐好像在发抖……）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1494.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"06984a623f59308f6addcee9c2895406a7683c3d9c759f8580c27b9587ef1db8","ja":"（あっ！　そういえば、\n四条さんも、おばけがすっごく苦手って……！）","zh":"（啊！这么说来，\n四条小姐也超级怕鬼来着……！）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1494.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"85f963b0f532ebf3d9880440286e4b00489b9e0a9b32ec9cc5017b49c9cdb5e1","ja":"え、えーっと……き、きっと、単なる噂ですからっ！\n大事なお仕事ですし、気にしないで頑張りましょうっ！","zh":"额、那个……一、一定只是单纯的谣言而已啦！\n而且这是很重要的工作，别放在心上，一起加油吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1494.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"c27f4a88207987329dbfd2b8fba70a08d646c067da5e91e15b0ec74934e7c76a","ja":"し、心配無用、です……。\nわ、私は別に、き、気にしてなど……。","zh":"用、不用担心……。\n我、我才没有在、在、在意呢……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1494.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"8b3b47cb3908a2f67db556add4b438159f8310a822ed0c1ebb59dcf4562a4681","ja":"（四条さん、顔が真っ青だし、手も震えてる……\n私のせいで……！　うう～、ど、どうしよう～……）","zh":"（四条脸色惨白，手也在发抖……\n都是因为我……！呜呜～，怎、怎么办啊～……）","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1494.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"d871f426a5709aa405735755ac7b263c4262d736fb32fd625c0e258d072ba47c","ja":"……あっ、そういえば！","zh":"……啊，说起来！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:34:04+00:00"}
